SOURCE CODE
-----------
Under AGPL-3.0 section 13 and section 6, anyone who receives or uses Tarteel
(including over a network) must be able to obtain the complete corresponding
source. The app links to it in Settings -> About; the location is configured by
`extra.sourceUrl` in apps/mobile/app.config.ts.

