KNOWLEDGE PACKS AND THEIR DATA
------------------------------
The AGPL applies to Tarteel's code. Downloadable knowledge packs carry their own data licences and credit lines: each pack's manifest
lists every licence it uses, and the app shows the credit in Library and Source Detail. The rights decision for every source is recorded in
docs/licensing/INVENTORY.md. No pack is published with a source whose redistribution is undecided.
